X0 D G S B sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt ad=9.5903 pd=66.72 as=4.79515 ps=33.36 w=33.07 l=2.03
X1 S G D B sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt ad=4.79515 pd=33.36 as=9.5903 ps=66.72 w=33.07 l=2.03
